four dynamic TBs (C2-C5), they will be scheduled on SMX0-
SMX1 in the third round before the remaining two parent TBs
P6 and P7 which are dispatched in the final round. Compared
with the RR scheduler, child TBs (C0-C1) and (C4-C5) are
scheduled earlier (in the second and third round instead of the
third and the fourth round), which reduces the time gap from
their direct parents and increases the possibility of better cache
